            <ArticleTitle>Particle Manipulation Methods in Droplet Microfluidics.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1021/acs.analchem.7b01333</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This Feature describes the different particle manipulation techniques available in the droplet microfluidics toolbox to handle particles encapsulated inside droplets and to manipulate whole droplets. We address the advantages and disadvantages of the different techniques to guide new users.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
